step 3 "psswrd"
out flier "\n\r\xff\xfc\x01* You are responsible for knowing the rules (type 'rules').  Ignorance of \n\r  the rules is no excuse.\n\r* Important commands: help, commands, news, notes\n\r* Use the delete command to erase unwanted characters\n\r  \n\r[Hit Return to continue]\n\r"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 4 "@return"
out flier "\n\rWelcome to Charm.  Please don't feed the mobiles!\n\rThe Temple Square\n\r  You are standing on the temple square.  Huge marble steps lead up to the\n\rtemple gate.  The entrance to the Clerics Guild is to the west, and the old\n\rGrunting Boar Inn, is to the east.  Just south of here you see the market\n\rsquare, the center of Midgaard.\n\r     A small white fountain gushes forth here.\n\r\nNum          Name Unread Description\n\r==== ============ ====== =============================\n\r( 1)      General [   0] General discussion\n\r( 2)        Ideas [   0] Suggestion for improvement\n\r( 3)     Announce [   0] Announcements from Immortals\n\r( 4)         Bugs [   0] Typos, bugs, errors\n\r( 5)     Personal [   0] Personal messages\n\r\n\rYou current board is General.\n\rYou can both read and write on this board.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
